<title>USA: PaineWebber wins Maryland Dept of Transportation.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber wins Maryland Dept of Transportation.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it won $50 million of Department of Transportation of Maryland consolidated transportation revenue bonds, Series 1996.</p>
</text>
